Kernel build directories:

    GBA/      - GameBoy Advance console, plain build (mGBA / VBA-M / flash
                cartridge). Has no real disk: the root filesystem is a ROM
                memory disk embedded in the kernel image (device mr0; root
                on mr0a, swap on the mr0b EWRAM region).

    GBAED/    - GameBoy Advance with the EverDrive GBA X5 cartridge. Reads
                its root filesystem and swap from the cartridge's real SD
                card (controller ed0, device sd0); root on /dev/sd0b (2nd
                MBR partition), swap on /dev/sd0c (3rd). Reclaims the EWRAM
                swap region for user RAM, so it has a larger user window
                than the plain GBA build.
